# Subroutines
@scenario tutorial_lesson_11
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[char ginger global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: I'd like to use the same chime twice. I'll put it under one label and call it whenever I need it.
[call chime]
ginger: Find the chime label. Change the sound there, then replay the call.
> Review question -> check
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
ginger: Which command comes at the end of a local subroutine?
> return -> correct
> end -> retry
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show ginger guide confused]
ginger: Return resumes the caller. End finishes the scenario. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: Return resumes the caller. End finishes the scenario.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_11]
[flag tutorial_done_11]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_1]
@label chime
[sfx assets/tutorial/welcome.wav]
[return]
